1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,263
Hello, and thank you for joining us.

2
00:00:03,663 --> 00:00:08,748
In bazaars all over Pakistan, small clothing sellers have wonderful stock.

3
00:00:09,148 --> 00:00:13,879
But putting even one shirt online means photos, background

4
00:00:13,879 --> 00:00:18,691
removal, captions, sizes and prices, for every single item.

5
00:00:19,790 --> 00:00:22,751
So we built Vestire AI Listing Studio.

6
00:00:23,151 --> 00:00:26,262
One photo, and a complete listing.

7
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:33,120
Let me show you. The seller adds a single photo, straight from the shop counter.

8
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:37,829
There is no need to clean the background. Simply tap the garment.

9
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:44,096
Now, we press Generate, and you can watch every step in real time.

10
00:00:44,496 --> 00:00:49,145
Meta's Segment Anything model, in its compact SlimSAM version,

11
00:00:49,145 --> 00:00:54,318
runs in a background worker in the browser, so the page stays smooth.

12
00:00:54,718 --> 00:00:59,141
At the same moment, Meta Llama 4 Scout, an open-weights model,

13
00:00:59,141 --> 00:01:02,137
looks at the photo and writes the listing.

14
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:10,486
And here are the results. A clean cut-out, a white studio shot, and a flat-lay scene.

15
00:01:10,886 --> 00:01:15,344
Every image uses the seller's real garment, never an AI copy.

16
00:01:15,744 --> 00:01:18,925
If you type a colour, you also get a gentle colour preview.

17
00:01:20,030 --> 00:01:21,551
Everything can be edited.

18
00:01:21,951 --> 00:01:27,675
If a risky word like "original" slips into the title, the studio kindly flags it.

19
00:01:28,075 --> 00:01:31,653
Descriptions in English and Roman Urdu, captions,

20
00:01:31,653 --> 00:01:35,157
hashtags and a size chart are all ready for you.

21
00:01:35,557 --> 00:01:40,029
And the price is only a suggestion. The seller always decides.

22
00:01:41,130 --> 00:01:45,646
You can share to WhatsApp with one tap, or download the complete listing pack.

23
00:01:46,046 --> 00:01:52,455
Images, captions, listing data and a CSV file, ready for the store's import.

24
00:01:53,930 --> 00:01:58,783
For Vestire stores, there is also an optional Send to Vestire setting.

25
00:01:59,183 --> 00:02:02,014
It is off by default, and only creates a

26
00:02:02,014 --> 00:02:05,058
hidden draft, so the owner checks it first.

27
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:10,107
Hours of work, done in about a minute, and free to use.

28
00:02:10,507 --> 00:02:14,892
Vestire AI Listing Studio, built with Meta Llama 4 Scout

29
00:02:14,892 --> 00:02:19,042
and Segment Anything. Thank you so much for watching.

